<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Mapping Algorithm QA Dashboard — mapping_algorithm_cpp.v5</title>
  <style>
    /* ── reset & base ── */
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { font-size: 15px; }
    body {
      font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
      background: #17211f;
      color: #d4cfc4;
      line-height: 1.55;
      padding: 28px 20px 56px;
    }
    a { color: #87b38d; }

    /* ── palette tokens ── */
    :root {
      --green:   #87b38d;
      --yellow:  #e8c66b;
      --blue:    #6b9ec5;
      --red:     #c56b7a;
      --dim:     #21302d;
      --dimmer:  #1c2b28;
      --border:  #2e4a44;
      --text:    #d4cfc4;
      --textmid: #9aada7;
      --texthi:  #f4f1e8;
    }

    /* ── layout ── */
    .page-wrap {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    /* ── section headings ── */
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--textmid);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    /* ── header ── */
    .site-header {
      border: 2px solid var(--green);
      background: var(--dim);
      padding: 22px 26px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .site-header h1 {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      color: var(--texthi);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .site-header h1 span {
      color: var(--green);
    }
    .header-meta {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .algo-version {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--green);
      color: #13201c;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* ── status bar ── */
    .status-bar {
      background: var(--dimmer);
      border: 2px solid var(--green);
      padding: 18px 26px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .status-badge {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #13201c;
      background: var(--green);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .status-detail {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .stat-chip {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--dim);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    .stat-chip .label { color: var(--textmid); }
    .stat-chip .value { color: var(--yellow); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ── comparison table ── */
    .comparison-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
    }
    .cmp-col {
      padding: 0;
    }
    .cmp-header {
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .cmp-header.ours {
      background: #1d3530;
      color: var(--green);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--green);
    }
    .cmp-header.theirs {
      background: #252230;
      color: var(--blue);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--blue);
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .cmp-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .cmp-row:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
    .cmp-cell {
      padding: 10px 18px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .cmp-cell.ours {
      background: var(--dimmer);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .cmp-cell.theirs {
      background: #1d1d2b;
    }
    .cmp-feature {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .cmp-cell .ours-val  { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
    .cmp-cell .their-val { color: var(--blue);  }
    .cmp-cell .warn-val  { color: var(--red);   }

    /* ── two-col section ── */
    .two-col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .comparison-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .site-header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .status-bar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* ── card ── */
    .card {
      background: var(--dim);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 20px 22px;
    }
    .card h2 {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--green);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* ── improvements list ── */
    .improvement-list {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .improvement-list li {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--yellow);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: var(--dimmer);
      font-size: 0.83rem;
    }
    .improvement-list li .imp-title {
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .improvement-list li .imp-param {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #2c2c18;
      color: var(--yellow);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      margin-top: 4px;
      border: 1px solid #4a4818;
    }

    /* ── city profile showcase ── */
    .profile-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .profile-card {
      background: var(--dimmer);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    .profile-card .p-name {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--texthi);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .profile-card .p-organic {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--yellow);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .profile-card .p-districts {
      list-style: none;
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .profile-card .p-districts li {
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .profile-card .p-districts li .quad {
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      display: inline-block;
      width: 28px;
    }
    .profile-accent {
      display: block;
      height: 3px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .profile-card.manhattan .profile-accent { background: var(--green); }
    .profile-card.barcelona .profile-accent { background: var(--yellow); }
    .profile-card.paris     .profile-accent { background: var(--blue); }
    .profile-card.london    .profile-accent { background: var(--red); }
    .profile-card.generic   .profile-accent { background: var(--textmid); }

    /* ── chunk map viz ── */
    .chunk-outer {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .chunk-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 64px);
      grid-template-rows:    repeat(6, 40px);
      gap: 3px;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .chunk-cell {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #13201c;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
    }
    .chunk-cell.cbd  { background: var(--yellow); }
    .chunk-cell.mid  { background: #6a9e72; color: #0d1a14; }
    .chunk-cell.res  { background: #3b6657; color: #c4d8cc; }
    .chunk-cell.edge { background: #263f38; color: #7aaa90; }
    .chunk-label-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 64px);
      gap: 3px;
      width: fit-content;
      margin: 0 auto 4px;
    }
    .chunk-label-row span {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .chunk-legend {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .chunk-legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .chunk-legend-swatch {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .chunk-scale {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .chunk-scale span { color: var(--yellow); }

    /* ── map color legend ── */
    .tile-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    .tile {
      padding: 14px 8px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.35;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    }
    .tile .tile-hex {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0.7;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .tile-water    { background: #4a82a6; color: #d8edf5; }
    .tile-highway  { background: #c8a040; color: #1a1200; }
    .tile-road     { background: #9e8c72; color: #1a1500; }
    .tile-sidewalk { background: #b8b0a0; color: #1a1800; }
    .tile-land     { background: #6b8c5a; color: #0d150a; }
    .tile-park     { background: #4a7a42; color: #c8e8c0; }
    .tile-cbd      { background: #c8a840; color: #18100a; }
    .tile-res      { background: #7a8ea0; color: #0a1218; }

    /* ── inline code ── */
    code {
      color: var(--yellow);
      background: #1e2e28;
      padding: 1px 5px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }

    /* ── footer ── */
    .site-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 18px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--textmid);
    }
    .site-footer .footer-left { line-height: 1.6; }
    .site-footer .footer-right { text-align: right; }

    /* ── utilities ── */
    .mono { font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace; }
    .green { color: var(--green); }
    .yellow { color: var(--yellow); }
    .blue { color: var(--blue); }
    .red { color: var(--red); }
    .bold { font-weight: 700; }
    .small { font-size: 0.78rem; }
    .dimtext { color: var(--textmid); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page-wrap">

  <!-- ══ HEADER ══ -->
  <header class="site-header">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">QA Dashboard</div>
      <h1>Isometric City Mapping System &mdash; <span>Visible Test</span></h1>
      <p style="margin-top:6px; font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--textmid);">
        mapping_algorithm C++ v3 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Procedural tile-grid generator for open-world city RPG
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <div id="test-date">Test opened: &mdash;</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;">
        <span class="algo-version">mapping_algorithm_cpp.v5</span>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:4px;">
        <span class="algo-version" style="background:var(--blue);color:#0a1018;">schema: deployable_city_map.v2</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ══ STATUS BAR ══ -->
  <section class="status-bar">
    <div class="status-badge">6/6 TESTS PASSING &mdash; 78/78 SMOKE CHECKS</div>
    <div class="status-detail">
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Seed / Map&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">42 &nbsp;/ &nbsp;96&times;72</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Profile&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">generic_dense</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Total cells&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">6 912</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Buildings&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">164</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Road cells&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">1 213</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Facing-tagged cells&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">perimeter</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">Landmarks placed&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">5 (all types)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-chip">
        <span class="label">WorldGenerator&nbsp;</span>
        <span class="value">48 chunks planned</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ ALGORITHM COMPARISON ══ -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Algorithm Comparison</div>
    <div class="comparison-grid">
      <div class="cmp-header ours">Our System &mdash; mapping_algorithm_cpp.v5</div>
      <div class="cmp-header theirs">ProbableTrain MapGenerator (reference)</div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Determinism</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Full seed-based determinism</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Same seed always produces identical maps; serialisable, testable</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Determinism</span>
          <span class="warn-val">Non-deterministic (Math.random)</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">No seed control; each run differs; untestable for regression</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Road Generation</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Terrain-following DP + Grid/Radial/Organic archetypes</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Elevation DP ±5-cell scan avoids hilltops; archetype (Grid/Radial/Organic) selected by seed hash; ring roads for Radial; diagonal highway for Organic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Road Generation</span>
          <span class="their-val">Tensor field + RK4 streamlines</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Major/minor eigenvector integration; produces fully organic, non-rectilinear roads</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Block Finding</span>
          <span class="ours-val">BFS flood fill (tile-space)</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Fast O(n) cell traversal; runs on the already-rasterised tile grid</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Block Finding</span>
          <span class="their-val">Right-turn polygon graph walk</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Vector-space; constructs minimal cycle polygons; more geometrically precise</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Output Format</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Tile grid &mdash; game-ready</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">MapCell array; each cell carries type, zone, building, encounter rate, spawn flag</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Output Format</span>
          <span class="their-val">Vector polygons &mdash; render-only</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">SVG/canvas paths for visual display; no tile grid, no per-cell game metadata</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">RPG Metadata</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Full</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">encounter_rate, spawn_point, building type, floor/facade/roof, landmark role, zone, district</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">RPG Metadata</span>
          <span class="warn-val">None</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Visual-only output; no concept of encounters, zones, or game-relevant cell data</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Scale</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Game-world: 96&times;72 to 512&times;512</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Tuned to walkable RPG maps; chunk-composable for open world (8&times;6 grid, ~12.6 km&sup2;)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Scale</span>
          <span class="their-val">City-scale: New York+</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Designed for large-scale city visualisation, not game-grid cell traversal</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">City Profiles</span>
          <span class="ours-val">5 named profiles</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Manhattan, Barcelona, Paris, London, Generic &mdash; each with distinct road density, block size, organic level, district names</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">City Profiles</span>
          <span class="their-val">1 generic type</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">No named city archetypes; parameters adjusted manually per render</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Performance</span>
          <span class="ours-val">&lt;5 ms per 96&times;72 map</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Native C++ with deterministic codepath; suitable for runtime generation during chunk load</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Performance</span>
          <span class="their-val">Browser-limited, not measured</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">RK4 integration cost scales with road count; not intended for real-time game use</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Seed Control</span>
          <span class="ours-val">First-class seed parameter</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Exposed in CLI, JSON export, and CTest; drives all noise layers (FBM, rivers, elevation, buildings)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Seed Control</span>
          <span class="warn-val">Not implemented</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Math.random() called directly; no seeding API present in reference codebase</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Sprint 2 Borrows</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Perimeter facing tags, elevation buildings, WorldGenerator</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Block perimeter cells tagged with facing road category (highway/connector); elevation-driven floor count &amp; type selection; 8&times;6 WorldGenerator chunk planner with spec-correct seed derivation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Adapted From Them</span>
          <span class="small dimtext" style="color:var(--textmid);">Right-turn graph polygon walk &rarr; adapted to tile-grid perimeter tagging (street_facing field); tensor field organics &rarr; adapted to FBM drift; per-section city awareness &rarr; adapted to per-profile per-quadrant district names</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cmp-row">
        <div class="cmp-cell ours">
          <span class="cmp-feature">Sprint 3 Additions</span>
          <span class="ours-val">Terrain-first routing, city archetypes, ring roads, roundabouts, CBD offset, turn bias</span><br>
          <span class="small dimtext">Elevation DP highway routing; Grid/Radial/Organic archetype system; ring road for Radial; roundabouts at junctions; seeded CBD center ±5%; connector_turn_bias S-curves</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cmp-cell theirs">
          <span class="cmp-feature">No Equivalent</span>
          <span class="small dimtext" style="color:var(--textmid);">ProbableTrain has no archetype system, no terrain-following highway DP, and no roundabout generation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ IMPROVEMENTS THIS SPRINT ══ -->
  <section>
    <div class="section-label">Improvements From ProbableTrain Analysis &mdash; Sprint 1, Sprint 2 &amp; Sprint 3</div>
    <ul class="improvement-list">
      <li>
        <span class="imp-title">Organic connector curvature <span style="font-weight:400;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--textmid);">(Sprint 1)</span></span>
        Connector streets now apply per-segment FBM drift producing gently curved avenue/street lines. Stair-step 4-connectivity enforced so tiles always remain walkable.
        <br><span class="imp-param">connector_organic</span>
        <span class="imp-param">FBM drift</span>
        <span class="imp-param">stair-step 4-connectivity</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="imp-title">District name variety — per-profile, per-quadrant <span style="font-weight:400;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--textmid);">(Sprint 1)</span></span>
        60 unique district names across 5 profiles &times; 4 quadrants &times; 3 zones. Each cell carries <code>district_name</code> for NPC quest text and UI overlays.
        <br><span class="imp-param">district_name_profile</span>
        <span class="imp-param">quadrant NW/NE/SW/SE</span>
        <span class="imp-param">zone CBD/Midtown/Residential</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="imp-title">Block perimeter facing tags <span style="font-weight:400;font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--textmid);">(Sprint 2)</span></span>
        Adapted from ProbableTrain's right-turn graph polygon walk: every block-boundary cell now carries <code>street_facing</code> = &ldquo;highway&rdquo;, &ldquo;connector&rdquo;, or &ldquo;&rdquo; (interior). Enables sprite selection, setback orientation, and commercial-faces-road placement logic.
        <br><span class="imp-param">street_facing</span>
        <span class="imp-param">highway/connector/interior</span>
